{"unit_id":"Lphehe__dsh-composer-assist#card-zh","repo":"Lphehe/dsh-composer-assist","commit":"2aef8fcdec18eff85c53893329360f2631b5f575","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-assist 是一款 DSH Web 插件，为输入框提供下一条消息预测、草稿续写和提示词润色。它在会话输入区加入建议栏、预测与润色按钮，并提供独立设置页，可选择自动或手动模式、显示方式和预测模型。建议按会话关联，过期响应会被丢弃；按 Tab 仅填入草稿，不会自动发送。适合希望更快撰写 DSH 对话消息的用户。无需额外插件密钥，调用当前会话模型或设置中选择的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:330-339","index.js:513-707","client.js:1355-1388"]}
{"unit_id":"Lphehe__dsh-composer-assist#card-en","repo":"Lphehe/dsh-composer-assist","commit":"2aef8fcdec18eff85c53893329360f2631b5f575","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-composer-assist predicts next messages, completes drafts, and polishes prompts in the DSH web composer. It adds a suggestion bar, buttons, and settings for mode, display, and model. Suggestions stay with their session; Tab fills the draft without sending. It uses the session or selected model.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:330-339","index.js:513-707","client.js:1355-1388"]}
