{"unit_id":"Lphehe__dsh-composer-assist#feature-1","repo":"Lphehe/dsh-composer-assist","commit":"2aef8fcdec18eff85c53893329360f2631b5f575","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-assist 的功能「下一条消息预测」：根据近期会话内容生成一至多个候选问句。默认在助手完成一轮后自动请求，也可从输入区按钮手动触发；候选显示在建议栏中供用户挑选。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:88-93","index.js:572-589","client.js:1035-1088"]}
{"unit_id":"Lphehe__dsh-composer-assist#feature-2","repo":"Lphehe/dsh-composer-assist","commit":"2aef8fcdec18eff85c53893329360f2631b5f575","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-assist 的功能「草稿补全与接受」：根据当前未完成的草稿生成后续文字并显示为建议。用户可按 Tab 将建议填入输入框，按 Esc 隐藏或用左右方向键切换候选；接受不会发送消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:94-95","client.js:1035-1088","client.js:1377-1388"]}
{"unit_id":"Lphehe__dsh-composer-assist#feature-3","repo":"Lphehe/dsh-composer-assist","commit":"2aef8fcdec18eff85c53893329360f2631b5f575","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-assist 的功能「提示词润色」：按下输入区的润色按钮后，模型将当前草稿改写得更清晰，并保留原语言、意图和约束；结果写回草稿框。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:96-97","client.js:1090-1119"]}
{"unit_id":"Lphehe__dsh-composer-assist#feature-4","repo":"Lphehe/dsh-composer-assist","commit":"2aef8fcdec18eff85c53893329360f2631b5f575","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-assist 的功能「预测设置」：在专属设置页切换启用状态、自动/输入补全/手动模式和建议显示位置，并选择会话模型或其他可用模型。还可调节上下文字符数、输出 token、输入停顿、超时和置信度门槛。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1143-1315","client.js:1329-1337"]}
{"unit_id":"Lphehe__dsh-composer-assist#caveat-1","repo":"Lphehe/dsh-composer-assist","commit":"2aef8fcdec18eff85c53893329360f2631b5f575","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-assist 使用当前会话或设置中选择的模型发起预测调用；每次调用可能产生费用。自动模式默认在每轮回答后请求，可改为手动或关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:330-339","client.js:48-52","client.js:72-74"]}
{"unit_id":"Lphehe__dsh-composer-assist#caveat-2","repo":"Lphehe/dsh-composer-assist","commit":"2aef8fcdec18eff85c53893329360f2631b5f575","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"生成上下文包含近期对话、最多四段工具结果、有限的顶层文件名与 Git 状态；代码不读取工作区文件内容，名称匹配凭据特征的条目会被过滤。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:192-245","index.js:254-328"]}
